label: Player Projections
description: Rest-of-season / next-season player projections (goals, assists, points) with bio context.

ai_context: |
  One row per player (latest projection run only; projected_on is the run date).
  Rates blend three seasons with a regression-to-position-mean prior; players need 30+ recent games to qualify.
  These are analytical projections, not betting advice.

